 1. k*A-k*B=N-1
 2. (k+1)*A-k*B=N-1

 However case #1 cannot happen. If happened, step is beyond N-1 😡

 There are two points

 1. Transform formula to upper-bound by multiple of two variables

 (k+1)*A+k*B=N-1

 2. Recurrence relation for # of steps



 */

const int MAX_N=1e6+1;
